        "is_self": false,
        "is_post_author": false
      },
      "text": "I was privileged to lead the team in the Netherlands that developed the Dutch NEN 7541 Image availability standard. Currently a pilot is underway to provide access also through the Dutch MedMij PHR agreements. All patients portals that I have worked with in the Netherlands already provide consumer access to images through a webviewer. Works well. Imaging reports are available to consumers as documents of course.\n\nThe work is fully aligned with the work being done on Medical Imaging and Reports at the European Level, see e.g. https://x-bundles.ehr-exchange-format.eu/dom-9/content.html",
